 {
  "id": "q_che007",
  "type": "NVQ",
  "stem": "In acidic medium, permanganate oxidises iron(II) as $\\ce{MnO4^- + 8H+ + 5Fe^2+ -> Mn^2+ + 5Fe^3+ + 4H2O}$. The number of moles of $\\ce{Fe^2+}$ oxidised by $\\pu{1 mol}$ of $\\ce{MnO4^-}$ is",
  "images": [],
